@startuml classdiagram
skinparam Linetype ortho
skinparam groupInheritance 2

note as N1
In this diagram we are showing the classes and their methods that are used in the Allergens Dietary plugin.
and not any WordPress core classes or methods.
Likewise with Woocommerce.
end note

note as N2
The file called Allergens_Dietary is the main file for the plugin.
But contains 2 classes these must be separated in a later rendition of the plugin.
This to support the Single Responsibility Principle and maintain clean code.
end note

note as N3
All classes that do not have a relation are pure singleton classes.
Meaning there can only be one instance of the object at any given time.
end note

